Package: steve-engine-editor
Version: 1.2.2.1
Section: games
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: Steveplaystimr
Depends: libc6 (>= @GLIBC@), libstdc++6, libgl1, libegl1, libx11-6, libxext6, libxrender1, libxft2, libxi6, libxfixes3, libxss1, libasound2 | libasound2t64, libpulse0, libwayland-client0, libxkbcommon0, xdg-utils
Description: Block-based game editor
 Steve Engine Editor is a desktop application for creating games with visual
 blocks, costumes, and Box2D physics.
